<section class="cowl-dossier">
  <div class="cowl-topline"><span>COWL / WEAR 01</span><span>DEVELOPMENT PROTOTYPE</span></div>
  <div class="cowl-hero-grid">
    <div class="cowl-media cowl-media--hero">{% if product.featured_image %}{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1800 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', widths: '750,1100,1500,1800', alt: product.title }}{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="cowl-copy">
      <p class="cowl-kicker">MURMUR / CURRENT 01</p>
      <h1>{{ product.title }}</h1>
      <p class="cowl-lead">THE PRIMARY MURMUR SHELL.</p>
      <div class="cowl-description">{{ product.description }}</div>
      <div class="cowl-status"><span>STATUS</span><b>IN DEVELOPMENT</b></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cowl-specbar"><span>REMOVABLE LINER</span><span>MOLT CORE READY</span><span>SERVICE ACCESS</span><span>MODULAR SURFACES</span></div>

  <div class="cowl-system-grid">
    <div class="cowl-system-copy"><p class="cowl-kicker">ARCHITECTURE / 01</p><h2>SHELL.<br>LINER.<br>CORE.</h2><p>COWL is built as separable layers. The outer garment carries the silhouette. The removable liner carries routing and service logic. MOLT CORE carries structure and future hardware independently of the shell.</p></div>
    <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0748/5839/7847/files/murmur-cowl-system-map.png?v=1788915796" alt="COWL system architecture" width="1536" height="2048" loading="lazy">
  </div>

  <div class="cowl-detail-grid">
    <figure><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0748/5839/7847/files/murmur-molt-core-system.png?v=1788915809" alt="MOLT CORE" width="1536" height="2048" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>01 / MOLT CORE</b><span>REMOVABLE STRUCTURE</span></figcaption></figure>
    <div class="cowl-detail-copy"><p class="cowl-kicker">DESIGN LOGIC</p><h3>LOAD LIVES INSIDE.</h3><p>The shell is not the harness. Weight is transferred through the removable internal architecture so the outer garment can remain clean, fluid and serviceable.</p><hr><p class="cowl-small">Reference prototype / M-L geometry / final materials, sizing and release specification remain under development.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="cowl-end"><p class="cowl-kicker">MURMUR / SYSTEM</p><h2>FASHION FIRST.<br>THE SYSTEM DISAPPEARS.</h2><a href="/pages/system">READ SYSTEM →</a></div>
</section>

